            "review_title": "Review at The Bean Store",
            "review_text": "mark w\nBridgnorth, United Kingdom31 contributions\n0\nExcellent food and service.\nDec 2023 • Couples\nI am a meat eater but have a wife who is vegan, sometimes it can be difficult to find a balance. This restaurant which is vegetarian had such a wide range of dishes that even I could enjoy the food. The food was so good we went there on two occasions both times it was very busy but they managed to find us a table after a few minutes wait. It's well worth it. Good food for good value.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 25, 2023",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
