            "review_title": "Review at The Bean Store",
            "review_text": "komal k\n36 contributions\n0\nNice to find some dairy free dessert\nMar 2016 • Couples\nA nice place to find dairy free treats and unwind. It's open late and was quiet so we mostly had the place to ourselves. I had a hot chocolate with soya milk (warm not hot) and a taro soya pudding with grass jelly. The pudding was pretty bland and the grass jelly was almost entirely flavourless but still a nice taste of something new.\nWritten March 18, 2016",
