            "review_title": "Review at The Bean Store",
            "review_text": "Becky P\nDa Nang, Vietnam30 contributions\n0\nWorth checking out, you may be pleasantly surprised!\nApr 2013\nI can see why this small specialty eatery became popular so fast. The Bean Store offers tasty desserts, shakes, and meals made from soy. The eatery is clean and tastefully decorated. The staff and the manager are professional and efficient (they can speak English). I recommend trying their bean curd dessert, their cheese taiyaki,and oreo soy shake. This place gets busy and I suggest dining earlier than later (they will run out of food sometimes). If you are looking for a place to hang out, eat guilt-free, relax and enjoy the cozy atmosphere, then check out The Bean Store.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 14, 2013",
